blocks.en:
Evaluation Metrics. We evaluate the edited results across five dimensions:
(1) Visual quality: five VBench dimensions [ 18 ] , including subject consistency, background consistency, temporal flickering, motion smoothness, and imaging quality;
(2) Acoustic quality: AudioBox PQ [ 45 ] ( ↑ \uparrow ) measuring the acoustic quality of generated speech;
(3) Audio-visual synchronization: Sync-C ( ↑ \uparrow , confidence) and Sync-D ( ↓ \downarrow , feature distance) evaluated via SyncNet [ 8 ] ;
(4) Reference fidelity: ArcFace [ 10 ] ( ↑ \uparrow ) for facial identity similarity, CAM++ [ 47 ] ( ↑ \uparrow ) for speaker timbre similarity, and CLIP-I [ 39 ] ( ↑ \uparrow ) for image-level subject similarity;
(5) Background fidelity: PSNR ( ↑ \uparrow ) and LPIPS [ 52 ] ( ↓ \downarrow ) computed over the background region. For Swap and Delete , the background is obtained by segmenting the edited subject via SAM 2 [ 40 ] followed by a moderate mask dilation. For Insert , the inserted subject is segmented from the edited output, and the unmasked region is taken as the background.

blocks.zh:
评价计量。 我们从五个方面评价编辑的结果:
(1) 视觉质量:五个V Bench维度[18],包括主题一致性、背景一致性、时间闪烁、运动平滑和成像质量;
(2)声学质量:音频Box PQ [45] (\ opraft )测量所生成语音的声学质量;
(3) 视听同步: 通过SyncNet[8]评价的Sync-C(QQ 上行,自信)和Sync-D(QQ 下行,特征距离);
(4) 参考忠贞度:面部特征相似性的ArcFace [10] (\\ opral ), CAM++ [47] (\ opral ),扬声器平缓相似性, CLIP-I [39] (\ opral ), 图像级别主题相似性;
(5) 背景忠诚度:通过背景区域计算出的PSNR(XX)和LPIPS[52](XX\下行). 关于交换和删除,背景是通过SAM 2[40]对被编辑的主题进行分解,然后是中度口罩放大. 插入时,插入的主题从已编辑的输出中分出,而未显示的区域作为背景。

blocks.en:
To ensure pristine quality and fidelity across the synthesized dataset, we incorporate a rigorous quality verification suite throughout the entire synthesis workflow:
1) Raw Data Pre-Filtering : VBench [ 18 ] evaluates video aesthetics and temporal smoothness, while SyncNet [ 8 ] filters out audio-visual synchronization offsets;
2) Synthesis Quality Control : Qwen3.5 checks the precision of SAM 2 masks and prompt bounding boxes, while ClearVoice [ 54 ] performs denoising and enhancement on cloned speech;
3) Cross-Pair Audit : ArcFace verifies facial cosine similarity, CAM++ audits speaker identity consistency, and ASR combined with subtitle OCR cross-verifies spoken dialogue accuracy, ultimately yielding high-fidelity audio-visual editing pairs.

blocks.zh:
为确保整个综合数据集的原始质量和忠诚,我们在整个综合工作流程中纳入了一个严格的质量核查套件:
1) 原始数据 Pre-Filtering : V Bench [18] 评估视频美学和时间光滑度,而SyncNet [8]过滤出音频-视频同步抵消;
2) 综合质量控制:文3.5 检查SAM 2口罩和即时捆绑盒的精度,而ClearVoice [54]对被克隆的语音进行去名和增强;
3)跨对等审计:ArcFace验证面相相相近,CAM++审核演讲者身份一致性,ASR结合字幕OCR交叉验证口语对话精度,最终产生高真实度的视听编辑对等.
